# Websoft9 Platform — maintenance schedule
#
# The platform's own maintenance jobs (App Store sync at 03:00, platform release check at
# 03:30) are no longer scheduled here. They are seeded as platform scheduled tasks, so the
# console can show their schedule, run history and logs, and they register their cron entries
# through the scheduled-task runner in /etc/cron.d/websoft9-tasks.
#
# Keep this file free of entries: a maintenance job listed here would also run from the platform
# task store, and the two would race.
SHELL=/bin/sh
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin

